    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607560/extras/3f7696499d579d8d11c676bfa0386158.avif?t=1753644268\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, a gashapon machine spit out a different capsule, a ball that jumped into this playground in the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your gashan ball through different platforms in 60 seconds, collect your coins and reach the checkpoint!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face low gravity, spikes and much more in this playground in the sky?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging platforms;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheerful and engaging soundtrack;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New skins released;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guaranteed fun for the whole family!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607560/extras/3f7696499d579d8d11c676bfa0386158.avif?t=1753644268\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, a gashapon machine spit out a different capsule, a ball that jumped into this playground in the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your gashan ball through different platforms in 60 seconds, collect your coins and reach the checkpoint!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face low gravity, spikes and much more in this playground in the sky?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging platforms;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheerful and engaging soundtrack;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New skins released;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guaranteed fun for the whole family!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
